# Levy interface strings added by the UI module. Keys are relative to Mods.Levy.UI2.
ArmoryTitle: Armory
Close: Close
ReforgeFloor: Floor: {0}
ReforgeFloorGood: Good
ReforgeFloorGreat: Great
ReforgeFloorSuperb: Superb
ReforgeFloorBest: Best
ReforgeFloorHint: Click to change the reforge floor. A weapon is rerolled until its modifier is among the top half (Good), quarter (Great) or tenth (Superb) of what that weapon can roll, or the single best (Best).
ReforgeAll: Reforge to floor
ReforgeAllHint: Rerolls the modifier of every weapon in storage and the issue rows until it meets the floor. Each roll costs the standard reforge price from the barracks treasury. A weapon that does not reach the floor keeps the best modifier it rolled. Items are never lost.
ReforgeNoBarracks: No barracks treasury is linked to this armory.
ReforgeNothing: Every weapon here already meets the floor.
ReforgeReport: Reforged {0} weapons in {1} rolls for {2}; {3} reached the floor.
ReforgeBroke: The treasury ran dry. {0} weapons were left short of the floor.
ReforgeCapped: "{0} weapons did not reach the floor within {1} rolls and kept their best."
Orders: Orders
Sidearm: sidearm
Unarmed: Unarmed
PotionHealing: healing / mana
PotionBuff: buff
DepositOneGold: +1 gold
DepositTenGold: +10 gold
DepositAll: +all coins
WithdrawOneGold: -1 gold
WithdrawTenGold: -10 gold
DepositHint: Move coins from your inventory into the treasury.
WithdrawHint: Take coins out of the treasury.
On: On
Off: Off
TaxShort: Tax to treasury
Toggle: "{0}: {1}"
UsedToday: used today
AllOrders: All Regulars
FollowAll: Follow
HoldAll: Hold
ReturnAll: Return
Roster: Roster
NoRegulars: You have no Regulars. Enlist one above.
WagePerDay: "{0} a day"
Home: Home: {0}
Homeless: No barracks
NotDeployed: Not deployed
DeadRespawn: Dead. Back in {0}s
Dead: Dead
Hp: HP {0}/{1}
Mana: MP {0}/{1}
MoreActions: More
MoreActionsHint: Patrol, feeding and rebasing.
BackActions: Back
ResizeHint: Drag to resize the roster.
Kills: "{0} kills"
FeedLifeCrystal: +Life Crystal
FeedLifeCrystalShort: +Life
FeedLifeFruitShort: +Fruit
FeedManaCrystalShort: +Mana
FeedLifeFruit: +Life Fruit
FeedManaCrystal: +Mana Crystal
RebaseHere: Rebase here
RebaseTo: Rebase to {0}
NeedTwoBanners: Place two Patrol Banners within 60 tiles of the barracks.
PatrolHint: Walk between the two nearest Patrol Banners.
PromoteMax: Highest grade
NoBarracksNearby: No barracks within 120 tiles.
MobilizeHint: Call up the militia of the nearest settlement.
StandDownHint: Send the militia home.
RallyHint: Steady every Regular within 30 tiles. Once a minute.
HoldFireHint: Soldiers stop shooting until told otherwise.
FireAtWillHint: Soldiers engage anything hostile in reach.
FollowHint: Regulars within 40 tiles follow you.
FollowHintRadio: Every Regular, anywhere, follows you.
HoldHint: Regulars within 40 tiles hold where they stand.
HoldHintRadio: Every Regular, anywhere, holds where it stands.
ReturnHint: Regulars within 40 tiles walk back to their barracks.
ReturnHintRadio: Every Regular, anywhere, walks back to its barracks.
SpreadOutHint: Soldiers keep far wider gaps, even while idle. Blunts area attacks.
CloseUpHint: Soldiers return to the normal tight formation.
SearchDestroyHint: Regulars within 40 tiles roam outward from the settlement hunting enemies, keeping their standoff.
SearchDestroyHintRadio: Every Regular, anywhere, roams outward from the settlement hunting enemies, keeping their standoff.
FreeReinHint: Regulars within 40 tiles act fully on their own. They roam far from you and the settlement, follow the fighting, and still keep their standoff.
FreeReinHintRadio: Every Regular, anywhere, acts fully on its own. They roam far from you and the settlement, follow the fighting, and still keep their standoff.
FocusDesignate: Click an enemy, a critter, or a spot to attack. Right-click or press Escape to cancel.
FocusCursorHint: Click a target or a spot to attack
FocusCancelled: Focus attack cancelled.
FocusSet: Focus fire on {0}.
FocusCleared: Focus fire cleared.
FocusClearHint: Stops the squad firing at the marked target or spot.
FocusAttackHint: Then click an enemy, a critter, or a spot. The squad attacks it until it's clear.
FocusAttackSet: The squad attacks the marked spot.
FocusAttackCleared: Focus attack cleared.
HudTitle: Army
HudHover: "{0} - {1}"

